# sol-callgraph

A focused call graph exporter for Solidity code using Slither.

## Installation

```bash
./.venv/bin/python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Usage

```bash
sol-callgraph <target.sol>
```

See `docs/sol-callgraph_requirements_design.md` for more details.
